an class=\"w\"><span style=\"--i:3\">Beyond</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--i:4\">Sport</span></span></span></h1>\n      </div>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"xhero__under\">\n      <p class=\"lead\">Life-skills programming is intended to prepare participants for independence, leadership, careers and entrepreneurship.</p>\n      <div class=\"btn-row\"><a class=\"btn btn--navy\" href=\"#interest\">Keep Up to Date<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></a><a class=\"btn btn--line-dark\" href=\"#interest\">Become a Mentor or Delivery Partner<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></a><a class=\"btn btn--line-dark\" href=\"{{url:/partners/}}\">Sponsor Life-Skills Programming<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></a></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"2eaf1452","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"status.mandatory-note","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"8949ad48","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"wrap\" data-el=\"status.mandatory-note\" data-el-build=\"elementor\" style=\"padding-top:56px\"><p class=\"note\" role=\"note\">All facilitators, curricula, safeguarding requirements, outcomes, dates and fees remain pending approval. No sessions are scheduled and none should be presented as available.</p></section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"8f7433c0","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"page.list-primary","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"be48e07c","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"wrap section\" data-el=\"page.list-primary\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"section-head reveal\" style=\"align-items:start\"><h2 class=\"h2\">Program themes.</h2><p class=\"body-lg muted\">Thirteen themes, delivered in short blocks rather than as a single course.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"hairline list-cells\" style=\"--min:255px\" data-stagger ><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">01</span><span>Communication</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">02</span><span>Personal organization</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">03</span><span>Time management</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">04</span><span>Financial literacy and budgeting</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">05</span><span>Transportation</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">06</span><span>Workplace readiness</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">07</span><span>Self-advocacy</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">08</span><span>Social interaction</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">09</span><span>Digital safety</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span>Personal responsibility</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span>Goal setting</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span>Leadership</span></div><div class=\"cell\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span>Entrepreneurship</span></div></div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"e8a01b8d","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"page.blocks","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"1ad43042","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"band--cream\" data-el=\"page.blocks\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"wrap section\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2 mb-l reveal\" style=\"max-width:26ch\">Delivery concept.</h2>\n    <div class=\"hairline\" style=\"--min:260px\" data-stagger>\n      <div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:240px;padding:34px 28px 38px\"><span class=\"num\">01</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Workshops</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px\">Short facilitated sessions on a single theme, sized to fit inside an existing program block. Subject to approved facilitators and schedules.</p></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:240px;padding:34px 28px 38px\"><span class=\"num\">02</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Mentoring</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px\">One-to-one and small-group mentoring, with mentors screened before any participant contact.</p></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:240px;padding:34px 28px 38px\"><span class=\"num\">03</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Integrated modules</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px\">Themes built into athlete-development sessions so the learning is not separated from the training.</p></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:240px;padding:34px 28px 38px\"><span class=\"num\">04</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Family resources</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px\">Material families can use at home, written in plain language.</p></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:240px;padding:34px 28px 38px\"><span class=\"num\">05</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Partner-led learning</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px\">Sessions delivered by employer, education and community partners under the same safeguarding requirements.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"1082f749","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"page.interest-form","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"de3c8daf","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"wrap section \" id=\"interest\" data-el=\"page.interest-form\" data-el-build=\"plugin\">\n  <div class=\"split split--form\">\n    <div class=\"form-intro reveal\">\n      <h2 class=\"h2\">Keep up to date.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-lg\">For participants, families, and anyone offering to mentor or deliver.</p>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">Safeguarding screening applies to every mentor and delivery partner before contact with participants.</p>\n    </div>\n    \n<form class=\"form\" data-preview-form>\n  <p class=\"small muted\">Fields marked <span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color:var(--danger)\">*</span><span class=\"sr-only\">with an asterisk</span> are required.</p>\n  <div class=\"form__grid\">\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f82\">Name<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f82\" name=\"name\" aria-describedby=\"f82-err\" required aria-required=\"true\" placeholder=\"Full name\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f82-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f83\">Email<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"email\" id=\"f83\" name=\"email\" aria-describedby=\"f83-err\" required aria-required=\"true\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f83-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f84\">Participant age range<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <select id=\"f84\" name=\"participant-age-range\" aria-describedby=\"f84-err\" required aria-required=\"true\"><option value=\"\">Please select</option><option value=\"Under 8\">Under 8</option><option value=\"8–11\">8–11</option><option value=\"12–14\">12–14</option><option value=\"15–17\">15–17</option><option value=\"18–24\">18–24</option><option value=\"25+\">25+</option><option value=\"Not applicable\">Not applicable</option></select>\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f84-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f85\">Region<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f85\" name=\"region\" aria-describedby=\"f85-err\" required aria-required=\"true\" placeholder=\"City or region\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f85-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f86\">Topics of interest<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <select id=\"f86\" name=\"topics-of-interest\" aria-describedby=\"f86-err\" required aria-required=\"true\"><option value=\"\">Please select</option><option value=\"Communication\">Communication</option><option value=\"Personal organization\">Personal organization</option><option value=\"Time management\">Time management</option><option value=\"Financial literacy and budgeting\">Financial literacy and budgeting</option><option value=\"Transportation\">Transportation</option><option value=\"Workplace readiness\">Workplace readiness</option><option value=\"Self-advocacy\">Self-advocacy</option><option value=\"Social interaction\">Social interaction</option><option value=\"Digital safety\">Digital safety</option><option value=\"Goal setting\">Goal setting</option><option value=\"Leadership\">Leadership</option><option value=\"Entrepreneurship\">Entrepreneurship</option></select>\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f86-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f87\">Preferred format <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <select id=\"f87\" name=\"preferred-format\" aria-describedby=\"f87-err\"><option value=\"\">Please select</option><option value=\"Workshop\">Workshop</option><option value=\"Mentoring\">Mentoring</option><option value=\"Integrated into training\">Integrated into training</option><option value=\"Either\">Either</option></select>\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f87-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f88\">Preferred timeframe <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <select id=\"f88\" name=\"preferred-timeframe\" aria-describedby=\"f88-err\"><option value=\"\">Please select</option><option value=\"As soon as available\">As soon as available</option><option value=\"Next 3 months\">Next 3 months</option><option value=\"Next 6 months\">Next 6 months</option><option value=\"Just keeping in touch\">Just keeping in touch</option></select>\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f88-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f89\">Mentor or delivery partner interest <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <select id=\"f89\" name=\"mentor-or-delivery-partner-interest\" aria-describedby=\"f89-err\"><option value=\"\">Please select</option><option value=\"No — participant or family\">No — participant or family</option><option value=\"Yes — mentor\">Yes — mentor</option><option value=\"Yes — delivery partner\">Yes — delivery partner</option><option value=\"Yes — sponsor\">Yes — sponsor</option></select>\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f89-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field field--full\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f90\">Accommodation <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <textarea id=\"f90\" name=\"accommodation\" aria-describedby=\"f90-err\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Optional\"></textarea>\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f90-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div></div>\n  <label class=\"check\" for=\"f81\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"f81\" name=\"consent\" required aria-describedby=\"f81-err\"><span>I agree to be contacted about this inquiry and to receive occasional updates from AFSV VRC. You can unsubscribe at any time.<span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f81-err\"></span></span></label>\n  <div class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" tabindex=\"-1\" hidden><strong>Thank you.</strong>Development preview — this form is not connected yet. On the live site it routes to a named owner and sends an automatic confirmation.</div>\n  <div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn--navy\">Submit inquiry<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></button></div>\n</form>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"e3ec1d5f","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"status.pending-inputs","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"2f43023b","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"wrap\" data-el=\"status.pending-inputs\" data-el-build=\"elementor\" style=\"padding-bottom:88px\">\n  <div class=\"pending\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Pending inputs</span>\n    <p>Page copy follows the approved brief. Still outstanding: final photography, approved logos and partner permissions, mailbox routing, legal policies, operational program data, pricing, dates and a named content owner.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"ef6f40cf","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"cta.band","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"7242eb8a","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"cta-band\" data-el=\"cta.band\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"cta-band__inner band--navy\">\n      <span class=\"cta-band__glow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <h2 class=\"reveal\">Sponsors fund whole blocks of life-skills programming.</h2>\n      <div class=\"btn-row btn-row--stack\"><a class=\"btn btn--gold\" href=\"{{url:/partners/}}\">Talk to the partnerships team<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></a></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]}]}